msgctxt "80"
msgid "Hey, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Huh? Do you need something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "You the one making Iriomote wildcat deals, or what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Iriomote wildcats? The hell are you accusing me of?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "They're a protected species, ya know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Wait a minute... I heard on the news some shady middleman was makin' "
"illegal deals. That wouldn't be you, now, would it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Never mind. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Can't you do this without riling up my customers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Sure, that man had a red Hawaiian shirt on, but he wasn't wearing a hat, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"The criminal's <Color:7>fat<Color:Default>, and he's wearing a "
"<Color:7>green hat<Color:Default> and a <Color:7>red Hawaiian "
"shirt<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Look, if you stir this place up too much, the guy's gonna slip away. Just "
"try to be cautious, please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Got it. Fat man, green hat, red Hawaiian shirt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Kiryu-san! You catch that fat bastard yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Then maybe it was him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "What was who?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Well... I just saw a fat man in a red Hawaiian shirt leave the market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Dammit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Probably noticed you, and decided to cut his losses and run..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Sorry. Guess I blew it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Ah, don't worry about it... He knows we're onto him now. I bet he'll think "
"twice before showing his face around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Hope the law catches up with him someday, but at least he's not my market's "
"problem anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Anyway, you did all right. Take this with my thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "I hope you can lend us a hand the next time something comes up, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

